<article class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><h3>Send photos or call</h3><p>WhatsApp clear photos of the waste, or call if the job needs explaining.</p></article>
<article class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><h3>Confirm the quote</h3><p>The team gives you a clear price based on the load and waste type.</p></article>
